@startuml seq_8_dedup
title 8. Dedup Hit: Same Path Returns Existing Region
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User" as User
participant "MemoryRegionFactory\n(singleton)" as MRF

note over User, MRF
  Another component in the same process
  requests the same SHM path. Region is
  already in the factory's dedup map.
end note

== Scenario A: weak_ptr alive ==

User -> MRF : OpenNamed(path)
activate MRF

MRF -> MRF : dedup check
note right : weak_ptr found.

MRF -> MRF : weak_ptr.lock()
note right : Succeeds — original\nholder still alive.

MRF --> User : Result<shared_ptr<MappedRegion>>
deactivate MRF

note right #LightGreen : No OS calls.\nSame physical memory, same fd.

|||

== Scenario B: weak_ptr expired ==

User -> MRF : OpenNamed(path)
activate MRF

MRF -> MRF : dedup check
note right : weak_ptr found, but...

MRF -> MRF : weak_ptr.lock() -> nullptr
note right : Expired. All shared_ptrs\nreleased, region munmap'd.

MRF -> MRF : Erase stale entry.\nProceed with full Open.
note right : Falls through to normal\nOpen path (no O_CREAT).

MRF --> User : Result<shared_ptr<MappedRegion>>
deactivate MRF

note right : Freshly opened region.\nNew entry in dedup map.

@enduml
